:PaymentsToAcquirePropertyPlantAndEquipment","l":"Payments to Acquire Property, Plant, and Equipment","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"}},"lines_struct":{"leaves":[{"id":"ncmi:NationalAdvertisingRevenueMember","label":"National Advertising Revenue"},{"id":"ncmi:LocalAdvertisingRevenueMember","label":"Local Advertising Revenue"},{"id":"ncmi:FoundingMemberAdvertisingRevenueFromBeverageConcessionaireAgreementsMember","label":"Founding Member Advertising Revenue From Beverage Concessionaire Agreements"}],"groups":[],"axis":"ProductOrServiceAxis"},"lines":{"ncmi:NationalAdvertisingRevenueMember":194500000.0,"ncmi:LocalAdvertisingRevenueMember":34600000.0,"ncmi:FoundingMemberAdvertisingRevenueFromBeverageConcessionaireAgreementsMember":14100000.0},"lines_py":{"ncmi:NationalAdvertisingRevenueMember":188000000.0,"ncmi:LocalAdvertisingRevenueMember":39100000.0,"ncmi:FoundingMemberAdvertisingRevenueFromBeverageConcessionaireAgreementsMember":13700000.0},"notes":{}}},"intro":{"text":"National CineMedia, Inc. (NCM, NASDAQ:NCMI ) is the largest cinema advertising platform in the U.S. With unparalleled reach and scale, NCM connects brands to sought-after young, diverse audiences through the power of movies and pop culture. A premium video, full-funnel marketing solution for advertisers, NCM enhances marketers' ability to measure and drive results. NCM\u2019s Noovie\u00ae Show is presented exclusively in 44 leading national and regional theater circuits including the only three national chains, AMC Entertainment Inc. (NYSE:AMC), Cinemark Holdings, Inc. (NYSE:CNK) and Regal Entertainment Group (a subsidiary of Cineworld Group PLC). NCM\u2019s cinema advertising platform, including Spotlight, consists of approximately 22,000 total theater and lobby screens in over 1,750 theaters in 183 Designated Market Areas\u00ae (98 of the top 100).","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1377630/000119312526344665/ncmi-ex99_1.htm","filed":"2026-08-11","source":"8-K"},"da_v":2}